    /// <exception cref="global::WebFunction.Exceptions.BadRequestException">code "INSTALLMENT_NOT_ELIGIBLE" - The installment plan you provided is not eligible for this payment, for example because the card, amount, or interest bearer does not match the plan, or the plan is no longer offered.</exception>
